  lyricsText:
  - 4:Welcome to the second challenge!
  - 8:For this challenge, we have placed six parts of a painting around the city!
  - 8:Your goal is to collect all six images before time runs out!
  - 8:You will be riding one of our electric scooters for this challenge.
  - 8:However, note that they sometimes don't act exactly how you want.
  - 4:Good Luck!
  - 8:(Use W and S to move forwards and backwards.)
  - 8:(Use left shift to boost, and use the mouse/trackpad to turn.)
  - '1:'
